 fourth quarter as No. 2 Utah beat TCU 38-17 for its 17th straight victory, clinching a spot in the Big 12 championship game.","published":"2026-11-22T15:41:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50561074/no-2-utah-seals-spot-big-12-title-game-beating-tcu","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Boise State's 4th-down gamble backfires as upset loss deals blow to CFP hopes","description":"Boise State's decision to go for it on fourth down instead of punting ended up backfiring when San Diego State got the stop and went on to kick a game-winning 42-yard field goal Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:46:11.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50560141/boise-state-4th-gamble-backfires-san-diego-state-wins","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chaos takes over the Big Ten: UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lose in Week 12","description":"UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lost to unranked teams in a year where parity is the ever-present theme.","published":"2026-11-22T07:25:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal112126/week-12-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T14:49:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:48:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4870944/chris-peal","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Peal"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Chris Peal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Peal","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:45Z","intro":"Christopher Jenkins Jardru Peal (born March 27, 2005) is an American college football cornerback for the Syracuse Orange. He previously played for the Georgia Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Peal attended Providence Day School in Charlotte, North Carolina. During his high school career he had 123 tackles and three interceptions on defense and rushed 246 times for 1,919 yards and caught 48 passes for 556 yards with 36 total touchdowns on offense. He committed to University of Georgia to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Peal played in five games at Georgia in 2023 and 2024. After the 2024 season, he entered the transfer portal and transferred to Syracuse University. In his first year at Syracuse in 2025, he started all 12 games and recorded 43 tackles. Peal returned to Syracuse for the 2026 season."}]}}